### 5. Fazer Login do ciclista (Armazena o token automaticamente)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "santiago@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}

### 6. Consultar cliente por ID (rota privada)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 7. Listar cliente (rota privada)
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 8. apgar cliente (rota privada)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/6
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}


### 9. atualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/7
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
   "nome": "Gabriel",
    "email": "Gabriel@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "celular": "47999999999" 
}


